---
layout: layouts/base.njk
description: "Phone intelligence APIs that turn numbers into useful data. Enrich existing phone numbers with caller names, carrier details, and routing intelligence."
---
{%- from "partials/macros.njk" import arrow, dot, chip, ghost %}

<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
	<div class="wrap">
		<h1 id="hero-title" class="hero__title">Know more from every number<span class="hero__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span></h1>
		<div class="hero__grid">
			<div class="hero__copy">
				<p class="lede--lg">Phone intelligence APIs that turn numbers into useful data.</p>
				<p class="text">Enrich existing phone numbers with caller names, carrier details, and routing intelligence. Improve contact records, investigate inconsistencies, and build smarter enrichment workflows with xGO.</p>
				<div class="actions actions--mt">
					<a class="btn btn--ink" href="/products/">Explore Our APIs{{ arrow() }}</a>
					<a class="btn btn--line" href="/contact/">Get API Access</a>
				</div>
				<p class="note hero__foot">Built for developers, data platforms, and businesses that depend on better phone data.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="hero__demo" data-demo>
				<div class="panel">
					<div class="panel__head panel__head--tabs">
						<div class="tab-row" role="group" aria-label="Choose a lookup">
							<button class="tab" type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-tab="enrich">Phone Enrichment</button>
							<button class="tab" type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-tab="cnam">Caller Name</button>
							<button class="tab" type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-tab="carrier">Carrier</button>
							<button class="tab" type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-tab="lrn">LRN</button>
						</div>
						<span class="label">Illustrative</span>
					</div>
					<div class="panel__body panel__body--demo">
						<div class="trace trace--input trace--input-lg">
							<div class="trace__rail" aria-hidden="true"></div>
							<div class="trace__content">
								<div>
									<p class="label">Input</p>
									<p class="trace__input"><span class="visually-hidden">+1 212 555 0123</span><span aria-hidden="true">+1</span><span aria-hidden="true">212</span><span aria-hidden="true">555</span><span aria-hidden="true">0123</span></p>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="trace" data-field="0">
							<div class="trace__rail" aria-hidden="true"></div>
							<div class="trace__content">
								<div class="trace__field">
									<p class="trace__name">Caller name</p>
									<p class="trace__key">caller_name.value</p>
								</div>
								<p class="trace__value">EXAMPLE BUSINESS</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="trace" data-field="1">
							<div class="trace__rail" aria-hidden="true"></div>
							<div class="trace__content">
								<div class="trace__field">
									<p class="trace__name">Carrier</p>
									<p class="trace__key">carrier.ocn</p>
								</div>
								<p class="trace__value">9101</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="trace" data-field="2">
							<div class="trace__rail" aria-hidden="true"></div>
							<div class="trace__content">
								<div class="trace__field">
									<p class="trace__name">Location Routing Number</p>
									<p class="trace__key">routing.lrn</p>
								</div>
								<p class="trace__value">12125550000</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="trace trace--last" data-field="3">
							<div class="trace__rail" aria-hidden="true"></div>
							<div class="trace__content">
								<div class="trace__field">
									<p class="trace__name">Routing context</p>
									<p class="trace__key">routing.state · routing.lata</p>
								</div>
								<p class="trace__value">NY · 132</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="panel__foot">
						<p class="panel__status" aria-live="polite"><strong data-product-name>Phone Enrichment</strong> returns <span data-product-note>caller name, carrier, and routing intelligence in one lookup</span>.</p>
						<p class="mono panel__count" data-field-count>4 field groups</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<p class="caption">Illustrative response. Not every field is available for every number.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--line" aria-labelledby="value-title">
	<div class="wrap split">
		<p class="label split__label">The value</p>
		<div class="split__body">
			<h2 id="value-title" class="h2">A phone number is just the beginning.</h2>
			<p class="lede measure">Your CRM might contain thousands of phone numbers. But how much do you actually know about them?</p>
			<div class="qlist">
				<div class="qlist__row">
					<p class="qlist__q">Who appears on the caller ID record?</p>
					<p class="qlist__key">{{ dot() }}caller_name</p>
				</div>
				<div class="qlist__row">
					<p class="qlist__q">Which carrier is associated with the number?</p>
					<p class="qlist__key">{{ dot() }}carrier</p>
				</div>
				<div class="qlist__row">
					<p class="qlist__q">What routing information is available?</p>
					<p class="qlist__key">{{ dot() }}routing</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<p class="lede measure-lg mt-md"><span class="strong">xGO helps you answer those questions.</span> Add useful context to the numbers you already have and put that information to work across your business.</p>
			<div class="grid features">
				<div class="feature">
					<h3 class="feature__title">Enrich your data</h3>
					<p class="text-sm">Add caller-name and network information to existing contact records.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="feature">
					<h3 class="feature__title">Investigate inconsistencies</h3>
					<p class="text-sm">Compare phone intelligence against the information already in your CRM.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="feature">
					<h3 class="feature__title">Build better workflows</h3>
					<p class="text-sm">Bring telecommunications data into applications, enrichment pipelines, and automated processes.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--line section--mist" aria-labelledby="products-title">
	<div class="wrap">
		<div class="split">
			<p class="label split__label">Products</p>
			<div class="split__body">
				<h2 id="products-title" class="h2">The phone intelligence you need. Nothing you don't.</h2>
				<p class="lede measure">Access individual data products or combine them into one enrichment workflow.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="spotlight">
			<div class="spotlight__copy">
				<p class="label label--ink">Phone Enrichment</p>
				<h3 class="spotlight__title">More information from every phone number.</h3>
				<p class="text">Retrieve available caller-name, carrier, and routing intelligence in one lookup.</p>
				<p class="text">Use it to enrich records, investigate unknown numbers, and add context to existing datasets.</p>
				<div class="mt-xs"><a class="btn btn--ink" href="/products/phone-enrichment/">Explore Phone Enrichment{{ arrow() }}</a></div>
			</div>
			<div class="spotlight__art" aria-hidden="true">
				<div class="combine">
					<div class="combine__inputs">
						<span class="combine__chip">Caller name</span>
						<span class="combine__chip">Carrier</span>
						<span class="combine__chip">Routing &amp; LRN</span>
					</div>
					<svg class="combine__lines" viewBox="0 0 64 144"><path d="M0 20.5H32M0 72.5H64M0 124.5H32M32.5 20.5V125"/></svg>
					<div class="combine__out">
						<span class="dot dot--14"></span>
						<span class="combine__label">
							<span class="combine__name">Phone Enrichment</span>
							<span class="combine__meta">one lookup</span>
						</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="prodlist">
			{%- for key in ["cnam", "carrier", "lrn"] %}
			{%- set item = products[key] %}
			<div class="prodlist__row">
				<div class="prodlist__head">
					<h3 class="prodlist__title"><a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.name }}</a></h3>
					<p class="prodlist__key">{{ item.code }}</p>
				</div>
				<div class="prodlist__body">
					<p class="prodlist__lead">{{ item.tagline }}</p>
					<p class="prodlist__text">
						{%- if key == "cnam" %}Retrieve available caller-name information for a phone number and compare it with the information you already have.
						{%- elif key == "carrier" %}Access carrier-related information to enrich contact records and understand the network context associated with a phone number.
						{%- else %}Retrieve Location Routing Numbers for telecommunications analysis, portability-aware workflows, and routing research.{% endif -%}
					</p>
				</div>
				<a class="link-arrow prodlist__link" href="{{ item.url }}">Explore<span class="visually-hidden"> {{ item.name }}</span>{{ arrow() }}</a>
			</div>
			{%- endfor %}
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--line" aria-labelledby="use-title">
	<div class="wrap">
		<div class="split">
			<p class="label split__label">How customers use <span class="brand">xGO</span></p>
			<div class="split__body">
				<h2 id="use-title" class="h2">Better data makes better decisions possible.</h2>
				<p class="lede measure">xGO brings phone intelligence into the workflows your business already uses.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="grid cases">
			<div class="case">
				<p class="label">Sales &amp; RevOps</p>
				<h3 class="case__title">Add context to every contact.</h3>
				<p class="text-sm">Enrich CRM records with available caller-name and carrier information. Investigate unknown numbers and flag records that may need review.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="case">
				<p class="label">Data Enrichment Platforms</p>
				<h3 class="case__title">Add another layer of phone intelligence.</h3>
				<p class="text-sm">Integrate caller-name, carrier, and routing data into your enrichment products. Give customers more information about the numbers they already have.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="case">
				<p class="label">Fraud &amp; Risk Teams</p>
				<h3 class="case__title">Add network context to your investigations.</h3>
				<p class="text-sm">Use available carrier and routing information as supporting signals when investigating account activity, unusual phone records, or potential inconsistencies.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="case">
				<p class="label">Developers</p>
				<h3 class="case__title">Build phone intelligence into your applications.</h3>
				<p class="text-sm">Access structured data through APIs designed for integration into existing applications and automated workflows.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="mt-md"><a class="link-arrow" href="/solutions/">Explore Solutions{{ arrow() }}</a></div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--line" aria-labelledby="how-title">
	<div class="wrap">
		<div class="split">
			<p class="label split__label">How it works</p>
			<div class="split__body">
				<h2 id="how-title" class="h2">From phone number to useful data.</h2>
				<p class="lede">Three simple steps.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<ol class="grid steps">
			<li class="step">
				<span class="step__num">01</span>
				<h3 class="step__title">Submit a phone number</h3>
				<p class="step__text">Start with a phone number already in your CRM, application, or dataset.</p>
			</li>
			<li class="step">
				<span class="step__num">02</span>
				<h3 class="step__title">Choose the intelligence you need</h3>
				<p class="step__text">Retrieve caller-name, carrier, routing, or combined enrichment information.</p>
			</li>
			<li class="step">
				<span class="step__num">03</span>
				<h3 class="step__title">Put the data to work</h3>
				<p class="step__text">Add returned fields to contact records, use them in automated workflows, or surface them in your applications.</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
		<div class="mt-md"><a class="link-arrow" href="/developers/">View API Documentation{{ arrow() }}</a></div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--ink" aria-labelledby="dev-title">
	<div class="wrap pair">
		<div class="pair__copy">
			<p class="label">Developer experience</p>
			<h2 id="dev-title" class="h2">Built to fit your workflow.</h2>
			<p class="text-md measure-sm">Whether you're enriching a single record or processing large datasets, xGO is designed to make phone intelligence easier to access.</p>
			<div class="grid bullets">
				<div class="bullet">
					{{ dot("dot--7") }}
					<div>
						<p class="bullet__title">REST APIs</p>
						<p class="bullet__text">Connect phone intelligence to your existing applications.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="bullet">
					{{ dot("dot--7") }}
					<div>
						<p class="bullet__title">Structured responses</p>
						<p class="bullet__text">Work with data that can be mapped into your systems.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="bullet">
					{{ dot("dot--7") }}
					<div>
						<p class="bullet__title">Individual or combined lookups</p>
						<p class="bullet__text">Request the information your use case needs.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="bullet">
					{{ dot("dot--7") }}
					<div>
						<p class="bullet__title">Bulk enrichment workflows</p>
						<p class="bullet__text">Apply phone intelligence across larger datasets.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="mt-xs"><a class="btn btn--signal" href="/developers/">Start Building{{ arrow() }}</a></div>
		</div>
		<div class="pair__visual pair__visual--code">
			{%- set code = { name: "Phone Enrichment", label: "Illustrative response" } %}
			{%- include "partials/code-sample.njk" %}
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--line section--line-bottom" aria-labelledby="gv-title">
	<div class="wrap pair pair--top">
		<div class="pair__copy">
			<div class="gv-mark">
				<span class="gv-mark__brand">{{ ghost() }}<span class="gv-mark__name">GhostVerify</span></span>
				{{ chip("Coming soon") }}
			</div>
			<h2 id="gv-title" class="h2">Meet GhostVerify.</h2>
			<p class="lede--md">A new way to verify phone numbers and understand risk.</p>
			<p class="text">Phone possession and recent SIM changes can tell you more about the trustworthiness of an authentication event.</p>
			<p class="text">GhostVerify is being developed to bring carrier-powered verification and SIM swap intelligence into one product family.</p>
			<div><a class="btn btn--ink" href="/products/ghostverify/">Join the GhostVerify Early Access List</a></div>
			<p class="note">GhostVerify is in development. Availability depends on participating carrier networks and supported integrations.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="pair__visual dash-list">
			<div class="dash-card">
				{{ dot("dot--11 dot--hollow") }}
				<div>
					<h3 class="dash-card__title">Silent Verification</h3>
					<p class="dash-card__text">Confirm phone-number possession without requiring an SMS code.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="dash-card">
				{{ dot("dot--11 dot--hollow") }}
				<div>
					<h3 class="dash-card__title">SIM Swap Intelligence</h3>
					<p class="dash-card__text">Check for recent SIM changes and retrieve available change information.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="dash-card">
				{{ dot("dot--11 dot--hollow") }}
				<div>
					<h3 class="dash-card__title">GhostVerify Complete</h3>
					<p class="dash-card__text">Combine verification and SIM change signals in one workflow.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--mist" aria-labelledby="why-title">
	<div class="wrap split">
		<p class="label split__label">Why <span class="brand">xGO</span></p>
		<div class="split__body">
			<h2 id="why-title" class="h2">Focused on the data behind the number.</h2>
			<p class="lede measure">Phone intelligence shouldn't require you to become a telecommunications expert. xGO makes specialized network data easier to understand, integrate, and use.</p>
			<div class="grid bullets bullets--light">
				<div class="bullet">
					{{ dot("dot--ink") }}
					<div>
						<h3 class="bullet__title">Purpose-built phone intelligence</h3>
						<p class="bullet__text">Access focused datasets instead of paying for unrelated information.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="bullet">
					{{ dot("dot--ink") }}
					<div>
						<h3 class="bullet__title">Simple integration</h3>
						<p class="bullet__text">Bring phone data into existing applications and enrichment workflows.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="bullet">
					{{ dot("dot--ink") }}
					<div>
						<h3 class="bullet__title">Flexible product selection</h3>
						<p class="bullet__text">Use individual lookup products or combine them.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="bullet">
					{{ dot("dot--ink") }}
					<div>
						<h3 class="bullet__title">Built for real-world use cases</h3>
						<p class="bullet__text">From CRM enrichment to carrier analysis and fraud investigations.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--signal" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
	<div class="wrap">
		<h2 id="cta-title" class="cta-big__title">What could better phone data do for your business?</h2>
		<div class="cta-big__row">
			<p class="cta-big__text">Start with the numbers you already have.<br>Discover what xGO can add.</p>
			<div class="actions">
				<a class="btn btn--ink" href="/products/">Explore Products</a>
				<a class="btn btn--line-ink" href="/contact/">Contact Sales</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
